A 47-minute video of the Q&A session from Apple's 2010 iPhone 4 "antennagate" press conference has surfaced on YouTube, showing Steve Jobs, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/tim-cook/">Tim Cook</a>, and Bob Mansfield answering reporters' questions.<br/>
<br/>
